Debuggerview
	Only involve edit the .cpp file in src, and rebuild again, very simple
	So the Debug -> CPU Debugger info will log to window/duckstation.log
	The log format is my_label xxx



DuckTrace
	Edit all function, so that each function will log to ducktrace.txt, very advanced
	Not only add 2 ducktrace files, also involve edit cmake.txt files in /common folder
	Can use a controller to control what to log
	

Ducktrace_cpu debugger
	Edit only cpu debugger, so that each function will log to ducktrace.txt, very light
	DuckTrace is heavy, because it log every functions
ducktrace_cpu debugger is light, only log cpu debugger (debug -> cpu debugger)
	Not only add 2 ducktrace files, also involve edit cmake.txt files in /common folder
